# Autonomous agent workflow

1. Bind work to a requirement ID (`TILE-*` or `PLAT-P0-*` / `PLAT-P1-*`).
2. Read root `ARCHITECTURE.md` sections relevant to the change, then the matching requirement doc.
3. For deterministic behavior, add/update a failing test first when practical.
4. After changes, run the test/build commands for the packages you touched.
5. Report: requirement ID, files changed, test/build result, remaining checklist items.
6. Never mark Phase 1+ or morph/export complete based only on Phase 0 / legacy Three.js work.
7. Do not download large model weights in automated flows without an allowlisted fixture policy.
